From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <nobody@localhost>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 22:45:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-metal: wire fused QJL+Polar attn for embed (Lab D1b)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Claim GGML_OP_FUSED_ATTN_QJL_TBQ on Metal for Q4_POLAR V, project Q
128→256, dispatch kernel_fused_attn_qjl_polar_f32, and append fused
shaders into GGML_METAL_EMBED_LIBRARY. Aligns QJL block field names
with ggml-common (signs/d).
---
